window.products.push({"id":871038,"name":"Alexa Round Dining Table Dark Walnut Color Natural Rattan Wicker Handmade Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UxAfJyVcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your living room a touch of unique style with this Alexa Round Dining Table. The product is grandly styled; it features up-to-date details, allowing it to blend with many decorating styles. Natural leather that used at the rattan connection makes this Round Dining Table even more durable and sustainable. This is a must-have to suit your modern but classy taste. It is made from natural rattan, class A – ECO-friendly material, which comes to us from Indonesia. If you want to make your home cozy and beautiful – our family owned company is here for you. Having any issues with your order? Please feel free to contact us and we will do our best to satisfy your needs. We guarantee – all questions will be solved very quickly. All our products are made from the natural materials. That`s why color of any rattan item may look slightly different (brighter/lighter/darker). It also depends on the settings of your monitor. If you have any doubts, please contact us to confirm the color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UxAfJyVcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wickerix","source_asin":"B08161Y29D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08161Y29D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08161Y29D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":871039,"name":"Greenmall Hammock Straps, Hammock Tree Straps Set, 10 Feet Long, 12 Adjustable Loops Extra Strong Lightweight, Camping Hammock Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hTSvaCz6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Greenmall Hammock Straps are the best straps because of how easy and versatile they are to use. They will work perfectly with your hammock. Each hammock strap is 10 feet with 12 attachment loops so that you can have a more adjustable and easy setup. The loops being in a continuous series, will allow you to create a perfect \"hang\" on the first attempt in a minute or less. No more fussing with finicky suspension systems. Greenmall hammock straps require so little (if any) explanation that beginners pick it up quickly. These straps are dead-simple to use and understand. And they make tree selection easy, giving you flexibility in circumference and distance. Our straps are a major improvement to nylon or polypropylene straps because they are made from high quality 100% polyester. They will not stretch, even when wet. No more having to hang your hammock five to six feet high to keep your backside off the ground. And, of course, our straps are tree friendly due to their 1 inch flat design, so they won't rip the bark off trees! Our goal is to make your life less of a hassle while setting up camp or just wanting to take a quick break to relax. We’re confident you will find the Greenmall hammock straps the quickest, easiest and securest way to hang your hammock. Most important though, to us, is the customer service you’ll receive when you place your order today. Give our hammock straps a shot and if for any reason it’s not right for you, let us know and we’ll give you 100% of your money back. They also come with a lifetime warranty against material and workmanship defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hTSvaCz6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greenmall","source_asin":"B07B9SBLT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9SBLT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9SBLT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
