window.products.push({"id":871119,"name":"Royal Doulton Pure Platinum 45-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N0BS1DY8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Royal Doulton's Pure Platinum 45-piece porcelain set features a .5cm outer and .3 cm inner platinum band. Value priced with the legendary Royal Doulton quality. Set includes service for eight: 8-dinner plates, 8-salad plates, 8-bread and butter plates, 8-teacups, 8-saucers, 1- creamer, 1 covered sugar bowl, 1 open vegetable bowl and 1 platter. Amazon.com Pure Platinum from Royal Doulton sets a classy table for such commemorative events as anniversaries and bridal showers. Simply shaped, the glossy white porcelain is banded with not one but two broad bands of gleaming platinum, the outer band slightly wider than the inner. With no other patterning or details, the dinnerware is effortlessly accessorized with table linens of any color or design, and fine crystal stemware, suiting either a contemporary or traditional décor. Just about everything needed to fully set a table for eight is included in this 45-piece set. The set includes eight of each of the following: dinner plate, salad plate, bread-and-butter plate, teacup, and saucer, as well as an oval platter, round vegetable bowl, covered sugar bowl, and a creamer. While not suitable for use in the microwave or oven, the china is dishwasher-safe on a low heat setting, which certainly saves time on clean-up. Other serving pieces are available to further enhance this pattern. --Ann Bieri What's In the Box 8 place settings and 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: dinner plate; salad plate; bread-and-butter plate; teacup; saucer. The serving pieces consist of: oval platter; round bowl; sugar bowl; lid; creamer. 45 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N0BS1DY8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Doulton","source_asin":"B000ENALYI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ENALYI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ENALYI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":871120,"name":"Esschert Design USA EG17 Wasp Deterrent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZSh5gAbZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Esschert Design USA, we develop, produce and distribute unique home and garden gifts. Ideas are developed in-house and then produced exclusively for Esschert Design by the best possible manufacturers worldwide. As a distributor, Esschert Design USA strives to provide the best possible service on a timely basis, by making sure that we have enough products in stock in our warehouse in Thurmont, Maryland. We are continuously receiving merchandise from the central warehouse in Enschede, The Netherlands. o enjoy your garden, means you have to be in and around it. Esschert Design knows this like no other. Because this is how we feel, we have developed a product line from which an enthusiastic garden lover can pick any item and make his/her garden more enjoyable. We carry a collection of handy, original tools and helpful items that make working in your garden easier and quicker. As with our other collections Esschert Design brings to the Esschert' s Garden collection a broad range of articles with a wide range of prices that compliment nicely our other lines. In doing so we have not strayed from our philosophy of always bringing you original gift ideas for those of you who love the outdoors and want to spend more time in it. Turn your deck or patio into a no-fly zone with these imitation wasp nests. Research has demonstrated that wasps are territorial and avoid other nests. Hang in a protected area under roof eaves or on a porch. Works for camping and picnicking too. Measures 8.5 x 8.5 x 11 Inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZSh5gAbZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esschert Design","source_asin":"B00BBDNBME","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BBDNBME","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BBDNBME","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
