window.products.push({"id":871237,"name":"C545 H13 True HEPA Replacement Filter S Compatible for Winix C545 Air Purifier, Replaces Winix S Filter 1712-0096-00, 2 True HEPA Filter + 8 Activated","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LEItN+SLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀PERFECT FIT: The premium c545 replacement filter is fully compatible with Winix c545 Air Purifier. Part number 1712-0096-00, Filter S. Please check your purifier model before making an order. 🍀COST-EFFECTIVE PRODUCTS: Our C545 replacement filters contains 2 H13 True HEPA Filter and 8 Activated Carbon Filters, packaged well in sealed plastic wrap. They are an efficient investment. 🍀TRUE HEPA FILTER: High-quality H13 Grade True HEPA Filter works for 99.97% of airborne particles down to 0.3 microns in size, effectively improving the air quality of your home. 🍀EXCELLENT FILTRATION: The activated carbon filter of C545 filter replacement helps you solve the problem of unpleasant odors and gases. Extra 3 carbon filters provide you more chance to change it and keep your air fresh. It's the ideal and perfect air purifier accessory for fresh air and odor free. 🍀EASY INSTALLATION: Our True HEPA Filter has a little plastic grab tag, just make sure the pull tab is facing you when you put the filter in, so you can grab it when you want to pull the filter out. Easy to replace and disposable, no tools required. The filter is recommended to be replaced every 6-8 months and Activated Carbon Filter every 3 months for optimal performance. 🍀SUPER CRAFT: Our C545 H13 True HEPA Replacement Filter S is made of high-quality non-woven fabric, adopts advanced lower energy consumption and lower density structure technology verified by the manufacturer, with higher efficiency and less pressure to ensure maximum filtration. And the upgraded technology used in H13 true HEPA filter ensures energy saving and long service life. 🍀100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We value customer service and satisfaction. If you have any problems with the filter fitting your air purifier, please contact us through our Amazon home page. We will try our best to help you solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LEItN+SLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cabiclean","source_asin":"B0B93RJ7CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B93RJ7CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B93RJ7CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
