window.products.push({"id":871285,"name":"POWOBEST Adhesive Hooks,4 Packs Creative Cute Frog Wall Hooks,Damage Free Hanging Aluminum Alloy Utility Hooks for Towel Coat Bathroom, Kitchen,and Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N95jm1ESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Adhesive Hooks】: Our original hooks are very cute and stylish. These black hooks help to keep your home clean and tidy, saving lots of space. You can use the hooks to hang varying things like jackets, coats, bathrobes, bath towels, towels, hats, scarves, keys, bags, also serve as kitchen hooks for cooking tools, lids, utensils, spoons, soup ladles, dish towels. 【Strong Sticky Hooks for Hanging】: Small hook is made of sturdy metal alloy with an eco-friendly coating, making it waterproof, anti-rust and corrosion-resistant. The shower hooks will not fall off or rust after use in wet bathrooms for long periods of time. High-viscosity adhesive complements the hook to further its durability. This sticky hook has strong adhesion without falling off, which can support 4 to 6 kilograms under the right installation. 【No Nails Installation】：No tools, no drilling, and no damage to the wall. Just clean and dry the surface, remove the back side adhesive film of the hook, then press it firmly against the wall for about 30 seconds until it sticks. Recommend you wait for 24 hours before hanging something to provide extra strength and durability. They are easy to remove because no holes, traces, or sticky residues are left behind. 【Applicable surface】: This hanger hook can be used on smooth hard surfaces, such as tile, marble, metal, cabinets, glass doors, and wooden doors. But not suitable for non-smooth wallpaper walls, painted walls, plaster walls, or any rough textured surfaces, which will damage the wall or the hook can't stick. 【Not Applicable surface】wallpaper, painted walls, plaster walls, lime walls, and other non-smooth walls to use this self-adhesive hooks. 【Warranty】We provide 24/7 Customer service help you solve any problems you have met about this product, if you're not satisfied with this product please feel free to contact we will full refund or resend a new product to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N95jm1ESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POWOBEST","source_asin":"B0C6CYR4FQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6CYR4FQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6CYR4FQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
