window.products.push({"id":871653,"name":"The Geeky Days Vintage Sewing Machine Design Household Decor Coat Keys Bags Clothes Hook Bedroom Bathroom Hanger Towel Hook with LED Backlight for Sew","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BeuVqD3DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Decorating with our magnificent LED lighted wall art will allow you to express your unique style, design, and flair on the walls in your home, ranch, cabin, lodge, or cottage. Specification: Light in weight, this wall hook is easy to fix. Fix this on the wall of your entryway and it is sure to grab the attention of guests entering who will be full of smiles and praises.  A wall hook with a eye-catching led lighting sign is something just perfect for the hallway.  This one here is made from good quality black wooden 3mm thick and will last in prim condition for a long time.  It features five hooks. Use these hooks to hang keys, coats, sling bags or cloth bags. So well carved, it is sure to make the walls it is mounted on captivating.  Measures 11.8\" wide . 5 mounting holes drilled for mounting. 5 Hooks included but mounting hardware tools not included. 7 Colors LED Lighting Function: This wooden key rack wall rook is with led backlight. It is fitted with led linear and remote control.  The backlight is very easy in use. It can be connected via any 5V USB port. You can plug into different devices, such as a computer, desktop, laptop, TV, power bank, cell phone charger, 5V adapter and so on. The Led light is powered by USB.  You will be given a 17 Key LED Remote Controller to customize the colors of the LED light sign. With the remote controller, you will have a variety of light setting which include to power on or off lights, pause or play, dim or change speed of lights and also to create rainbow of colors.(Please note:Remote Controller CR2025 Battery is NOT included) Package Include: LED Lighting Hook*1 Remote control*1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BeuVqD3DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Geeky Days","source_asin":"B07CGGD1DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CGGD1DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CGGD1DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
