window.products.push({"id":871739,"name":"KIWEE Knee Pillow for Back & Hip Pain Relief, Sciatica, Side Sleepers | Orthopedic High Density Firm Memory Foam Leg Positioner Knee Pillow Contour We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iz-b0FwjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose the KIWEE Orthopedic Knee Pillow? At KIWEE, having Our customers live a healthy, happy and pain-free lifestyle is our commitment. We were so dedicated to improving your sleeping experience that we wanted to create a pillow that gives your body the ultimate comfort and support it needs. Our leg positioning pillows are responsibly made with the utmost care from the highest quality, densest and safest memory foam in the world. They are tested or inspected as many as 20 times throughout the creation process to maintain optimal quality, comfort and safety while performing at high levels. That's why you can order from us with confidence. PERFECT CONTOUR DESIGN You will love the innovative contour indent in this pillow for your knees and legs to rest in between. We have designed them to fit legs of all sizes, while maintaining ultimate bodily structure and support. PINNACLE SPINE & POSTURE ALIGNMENT Your spine alignment and bodily posture will never be so healthy as you sleep on your side with this knee pillow. It will keep your spine in a perfect line, while working to reduce any inflammation through improved circulation. FOR ALL AGES & LIFESTYLES We at KIWEE have designed this pillow to work perfectly for men and women of all sizes, lifestyles and shapes. The pillow will heat up from your body and mold to your exact requirements. HOW TO USE Place your pillow between your legs hugging the curved sides of the pillow. Visit our website for detailed instructions. REMOVABLE & WASHABLE COVER When your pillow has gotten sweaty, stinky or you simply just want to wash it, simply take off the included removable cover and throw it in the washing machine. Hand wash or machine wash on cold and hang dry. AIR OUT BEFORE USE When you first receive the pillow, ensure that you air it out before use to rid it of any smells and allow it to expand to its full potential. When first using the pillow, it will heat up from your body heat and mold to your leg and knee size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iz-b0FwjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIWEE","source_asin":"B089XZQQ9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089XZQQ9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089XZQQ9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
