window.products.push({"id":871790,"name":"Double Walled Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Sports Water Bottle with Lid | BPA Free Flip Top Gym Water Chug Jugs | 18 Oz Travel Slim Thermos Flask ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SSfPbOchL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Quality water bottle makes better life Our double wall vacuum insulated stainless steel water bottle is made of premium 304 (18/8) food grade stainless steel. Unlike the normal plastic water bottles or single wall stainless flask. The double-walled construction thermos leveraged the vacuum insulation theory to efficiently blocks the air heats spreading from the cup's inside to the outside. It's the core of technology which judge whether a vacuum insulation tumbler is premium or not. So this jug absolutely will keeps your iced water steady low temperature and your hot beverage always keeps the well warming. For the both summer day and cold winter, This quality vacuum insulated tumbler will be the best choice. There is no doubt a glass of cold water or iced wine can keeps you stay cool in hot summer and a cup of warm tea or hot coffee will be your intimate mate in a chilly winter. After the enjoying, you can just ease to put this dishwasher safe tumbler into the dishwasher. What convenient it is! However, a quality mug can makes you live better in many aspects. Specification Material: 18/8 food grade stainless steel Capacity: 18 oz (530ml) Cup Mouth Diameter: 2.76 inches Height: 8.86 inches Instructions to Use 1. Please clean the water bottle body and components with neutral detergent before first time use. 2. For effectively extend the life of the thermos. We recommend not to put acid and corrosive liquids for a long time. Such a carbonated beverage. It causes corrosion to the metal, destroying the metal wall, leads the thermal insulation performance of the thermos bottle is degraded. 3. When using, add a small amount of heat/cold water to preheat/ precooling, and then the insulation/cooling effect will be better. 4. Do not place the bottle in the microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SSfPbOchL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIQUO","source_asin":"B07SM1C2M6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SM1C2M6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SM1C2M6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
