window.products.push({"id":871836,"name":"Electric Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer Kit with Dehumidify Cup and 16 Jar Lids, Jar Vacuum Sealer for Mason Jars with Lid Opener and 2 Reusable Vacuum Seale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wWiyIKNcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you like to store homemade jams, coffee beans, or other delicacies, you definitely need a practical sealing machine to ensure the freshness and quality of your food. FEATURES: Efficient and effortless: The electric mason jar sealer uses an electric motor for fast and effortless sealing, eliminating the need for manual rotation and making kitchen work more efficient. Perfect sealing: The high-quality sealing technology of the electric mason jar sealer ensures perfect sealing, preventing food from leakage or spoilage and extending its shelf life. Versatile use: The electric mason jar sealer is suitable for various types of mason jars, as well as plastic bags and aluminum foil bags, making it widely applicable. Intelligent adjustment: The electric mason jar sealer can intelligently adjust sealing time and temperature to adapt to different types of food, ensuring food quality and freshness. Environmentally friendly: The electric mason jar sealer reduces food waste and minimizes the use of disposable sealing materials. OPERATION STEPS: 1. Fill the jar with food, but don't overfill it. Put the lid on the jar. 2. Place the vacuum sealer over the rim of the jar and turn it gently to ensure a good seal. 3. Place the electric mason jar sealer over the suction hole of the vacuum sealer and press it firmly. Pump for 6-8 seconds for the best vacuum seal. 4. Use a jar lid opener to remove the lid and access the food when needed. NOTE: 1. Avoid overfilling the bag to ensure proper sealing. 2. Position the open end of the bag correctly to prevent leaks. 3. Unplug the machine before cleaning or adjusting it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wWiyIKNcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meteralla","source_asin":"B0BNBDNCLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-871836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBDNCLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBDNCLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
